<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Сдать вещь в аренду — EMPIRE</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-white text-black">

    <div class="bg-black text-white text-center py-2 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase font-medium">
        Зарабатывайте на своём стиле — сдавайте вещи в аренду
    </div>

    <nav class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200 px-8 py-4">
        <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto flex justify-between items-center">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
                <a href="index.html" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Главная</a>
                <a href="shop.html" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Каталог</a>
                <a href="news.html" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Новости</a>
                <a href="contact.html" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Контакты</a>
            </div>
            
            <a href="index.html" class="absolute left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2">
                <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45"/><path d="M30 50 L50 30 L70 50 L50 70 Z" fill="none"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15"/>
                </svg>
            </a>

            <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
                <button id="search-btn" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Поиск</button>
                <a href="rent-out.html" class="text-sm font-bold border-b-2 border-black pb-1">Сдать вещь</a>
                <a href="dashboard.html" class="text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-70 transition">Кабинет</a>
                <a href="dashboard.html#points" class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 to-red-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                        <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="em-balance">0</span> EMB
                </a>
                <a href="cart.html" class="flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer hover:opacity-70 transition">
                    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M6 2L3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path>
                        <line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"></line>
                        <path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span class="text-sm" id="cart-count">0</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="bg-black text-white py-20 px-8">
        <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto text-center">
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-6">
                Зарабатывайте<br>на своём стиле
            </h1>
            <p class="text-xl text-gray-400 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                Сдавайте дизайнерские вещи, винил, аксессуары в аренду. 
                Вы зарабатываете — арендаторы получают стиль без покупки.
            </p>
            <div class="flex gap-4 justify-center flex-wrap">
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 min-w-[200px]">
                    <div class="text-4xl font-black text-red-500 mb-2">80%</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">ваш доход от аренды</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 min-w-[200px]">
                    <div class="text-4xl font-black text-white mb-2">24ч</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">модерация</div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur rounded-2xl p-6 min-w-[200px]">
                    <div class="text-4xl font-black text-white mb-2">0₽</div>
                    <div class="text-sm text-gray-400">размещение</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-8 bg-gray-50">
        <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-8 text-center">
                Калькулятор дохода
            </h2>
            
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg">
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-6">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Стоимость вещи ($)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="calc-price" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 focus:border-black focus:outline-none" placeholder="500" value="500">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Категория</label>
                        <select id="calc-category" class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border border-gray-300 focus:border-black focus:outline-none">
                            <option value="clothing">Одежда</option>
                            <option value="accessories">Аксессуары</option>
                            <option value="music">Винил/CD</option>
                            <option value="sneakers">Кроссовки</option>
                            <option value="bags">Сумки</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">В день</div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-bold" id="calc-daily">$25</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">В месяц</div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-600" id="calc-monthly">$600</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl">
                        <div class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-1">Ваш доход</div>
                        <div class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-600" id="calc-income">$480</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 text-center">
                    * При загрузке 80% и комиссии EMPIRE 20%
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-8 max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-8">
            Разместить вещь
        </h2>

        <div class="mb-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between mb-2 text-sm font-medium">
                <span id="step-label">Шаг 1 из 4: Основное</span>
                <span id="step-percent">25%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-2 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                <div id="form-progress" class="h-full bg-black transition-all duration-300" style="width: 25%"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <form id="rent-form" class="space-y-6">
            <div class="form-step active" data-step="1">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Название вещи *</label>
                        <input type="text" name="title" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" placeholder="Например: Supreme Box Logo Hoodie Black" required>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Категория *</label>
                            <select name="category" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" required>
                                <option value="">Выберите</option>
                                <option value="clothing">Одежда</option>
                                <option value="accessories">Аксессуары</option>
                                <option value="music">Музыка</option>
                                <option value="sneakers">Кроссовки</option>
                                <option value="bags">Сумки</option>
                                <option value="jewelry">Украшения</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Бренд *</label>
                            <input type="text" name="brand" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" placeholder="Supreme, Nike, etc." required>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Описание *</label>
                        <textarea name="description" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50 h-24 resize-none" placeholder="Состояние, особенности, история вещи..." required></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-step hidden" data-step="2">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Цена покупки ($) *</label>
                            <input type="number" name="retailPrice" id="retail-price" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" placeholder="500" required>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Рекомендуемая цена аренды/день</label>
                            <div class="px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-100 text-gray-600" id="suggested-price">$25</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Ваша цена аренды ($/день) *</label>
                        <input type="number" name="rentalPrice" id="rental-price" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" placeholder="25" required>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Рекомендуем: 5-10% от стоимости вещи</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-4">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Скидки при долгосрочной аренде</h4>
                        <div class="space-y-2 text-sm">
                            <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="discount3" checked class="rounded">
                                <span>3 дня — скидка 10%</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="discount7" checked class="rounded">
                                <span>7 дней — скидка 20%</span>
                            </label>
                            <label class="flex items-center gap-2">
                                <input type="checkbox" name="discount14" checked class="rounded">
                                <span>14 дней — скидка 30%</span>
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-step hidden" data-step="3">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-8 text-center hover:border-black transition cursor-pointer" id="drop-zone">
                        <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="mx-auto mb-4 text-gray-400">
                            <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
                            <polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"></polyline>
                            <line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"></line>
                        </svg>
                        <p class="font-medium mb-1">Перетащите фото сюда</p>
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">или нажмите для выбора</p>
                        <input type="file" multiple accept="image/*" class="hidden" id="photo-input">
                    </div>

                    <div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-4" id="photo-preview">
                    </div>

                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Минимум 3 фото: общий план, детали, бирка/лейбл</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-step hidden" data-step="4">
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Имя *</label>
                            <input type="text" name="firstName" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" required>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Фамилия *</label>
                            <input type="text" name="lastName" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Email *</label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" required>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Телефон *</label>
                        <input type="tel" name="phone" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" placeholder="+7 (999) 000-00-00" required>
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-semibold mb-2">Город *</label>
                        <select name="city" class="input-field w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-gray-50" required>
                            <option value="">Выберите город</option>
                            <option value="moscow">Москва</option>
                            <option value="spb">Санкт-Петербург</option>
                            <option value="other">Другой (уточним)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <label class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <input type="checkbox" name="agreement" required class="mt-1 rounded">
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-600">
                            Я согласен с <a href="#" class="underline hover:text-black">условиями размещения</a> 
                            и подтверждаю подлинность вещи
                        </span>
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex justify-between pt-6 border-t">
                <button type="button" id="prev-btn" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full border border-gray-300 font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 transition hidden">
                    ← Назад
                </button>
                <div class="flex-1"></div>
                <button type="button" id="next-btn" class="px-8 py-3 rounded-full bg-black text-white font-medium hover:bg-gray-800 transition">
                    Далее →
                </button>
                <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="hidden px-8 py-3 rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white font-medium hover:bg-red-700 transition">
                    Разместить вещь
                </button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-8 bg-black text-white">
        <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-12 text-center">
                Как это работает
            </h2>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl">1</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Размещаете</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Фото, описание, цена. Модерация за 24 часа</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl">2</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Получаете заказы</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Арендаторы бронируют через сайт</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl">3</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Передаёте</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">В пункте выдачи или курьером</p>
                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-2xl">4</div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold mb-2">Получаете деньги</h3>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">80% от каждой аренды на ваш счёт</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16 px-8 max-w-[800px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase mb-8">Частые вопросы</h2>
        
        <div class="space-y-4" id="faq-container">
            <details class="group border rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 cursor-pointer font-medium hover:bg-gray-50">
                    Что можно сдавать в аренду?
                    <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm">
                    Дизайнерскую одежду, виниловые пластинки, аксессуары премиум-класса, 
                    кроссовки limited edition, сумки и рюкзаки. Главное — подлинность и хорошее состояние.
                </div>
            </details>
            
            <details class="group border rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 cursor-pointer font-medium hover:bg-gray-50">
                    Как определяется цена аренды?
                    <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm">
                    Рекомендуем 5-10% от розничной цены в день. Система подскажет оптимальную цену 
                    на основе аналогов. Вы можете установить свою цену.
                </div>
            </details>
            
            <details class="group border rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
                <summary class="flex justify-between items-center p-4 cursor-pointer font-medium hover:bg-gray-50">
                    Что если вещь повредят?
                    <span class="transition group-open:rotate-180">▼</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="p-4 pt-0 text-gray-600 text-sm">
                    Каждая аренда застрахована. При повреждении мы компенсируем ремонт или 
                    рыночную стоимость вещи. Депозит арендатора также покрывает мелкие повреждения.
                </div>
            </details>
        </div>
    </section>

    <div class="bg-black text-white py-4 overflow-hidden border-b border-gray-800">
        <div class="marquee whitespace-nowrap">
            <span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-widest mx-8">100% НЕЗАВИСИМОСТЬ</span>
            <span class="mx-4">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="inline">
                    <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45"/><path d="M30 50 L50 30 L70 50 L50 70 Z" fill="none"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15"/>
                </svg>
            </span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="bg-black text-white py-16 px-8">
        <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto text-center">
            <svg width="50" height="50" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="mx-auto mb-4">
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45"/><path d="M30 50 L50 30 L70 50 L50 70 Z" fill="none"/><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="15"/>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">© 2025 EMPIRE DISTRIBUTION</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>


Стили: 
.input-valid {
    border-color: #16a34a !important;
    background: #f0fdf4 !important;
}

.input-invalid {
    border-color: #dc2626 !important;
    background: #fef2f2 !important;
}

.btn-spinner {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border-top-color: white;
    animation: btn-spin 0.8s linear infinite;
    margin-right: 8px;
    vertical-align: middle;
}

@keyframes btn-spin {
    to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.input-field {
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
}

.input-field:focus {
    border-color: black;
    outline: none;
}

.bg-white\/10 {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
}

.backdrop-blur {
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

#calc-daily,
#calc-monthly,
#calc-income {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}

.form-step {
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.form-step.hidden {
    display: none;
}

.form-step.active {
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
}

#form-progress {
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

#drop-zone {
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

#drop-zone:hover {
    border-color: #000;
    background: #f9fafb;
}

#drop-zone.border-black {
    border-color: #000;
}

#photo-preview {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
}

#photo-preview .relative {
    position: relative;
}

#photo-preview button {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.25rem;
    right: 0.25rem;
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 1.5rem;
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
}

#photo-preview button:hover {
    background: #dc2626;
}

details.group {
    border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    overflow: hidden;
}

details.group summary {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
}

details.group summary:hover {
    background: #f9fafb;
}

details.group summary span {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
}

details.group[open] summary span {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
}

details.group > div {
    padding: 0 1rem 1rem;
    color: #4b5563;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.w-16.h-16.rounded-full.bg-white\/10 {
    width: 4rem;
    height: 4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.w-16.h-16.rounded-full.bg-red-600 {
    background: #dc2626;
}

